00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.780
The Boring Company's $3 billion funding now backs Tesla-powered trucks hauling 20-foot containers underground. This is Tesla Shorts Time, episode 640. Intel's new process node, Japan's self-driving filing,

00:00:13.320 --> 00:00:29.640
Rivians point to point assist, then first principles on shared hardware. The Boring Company modified a Tesla Model 3 battery and drive unit for its latest proofrock liner truck, Tesla Roddy reports. Those same packs and drive units already ran on earlier liner trucks

00:00:29.640 --> 00:00:31.400
