00:03:06.344 --> 00:03:14.064
The homeowner calculated that EG4 units provided equivalent capacity at roughly half the installed cost of a comparable power wall setup.

00:03:14.064 --> 00:03:19.624
Local installers confirmed the EG-4 systems met Florida building codes for storm-hardened

00:03:19.624 --> 00:03:26.178
battery enclosures. The new roadster changes its shape when switching into track mode.

